# Phase 5 panels: launch with no credential and a malformed profile settings
# file. fx v0.0.16 refuses it at launch -- `fx: InvalidProfileConfiguration`,
# exit 1, before a first frame (a user-layer `malformed_settings` under the
# default local auth mode, src/core/app/app_lifecycle.zig:690-701@481104fd)
# -- and `keep` holds its dead pane as the snap. xfx starts and says
# `config: 1 configuration issue` (src/config.rs:850-851,
# src/tui/shell.rs:3820-3837): the ledger's `profile-refuse-at-launch`. The
# panel's `Settings` row for a profile that goes bad after launch is
# p5-panels-status-badsettings's; there is no TUI here to type `/status` into.
keep
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
env AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
seed p5-panels-badsettings.json
wait 3
snap launch
